      "message": "The style guide states that variables with static storage duration should be strongly typed and immutable where possible.\n\nIn **`cli_options.cc`**, the `getopt` long options array is mutable:\n\n```c\nstatic struct option long_options[] \u003d { ... };\n\n```\n\n**Fix:** Make it a `constexpr` array to enforce immutability at compile time:\n\n```c\nstatic constexpr option long_options[] \u003d { ... };\n\n```",
